# Hall-site project context

- **Stack:** Next.js App Router, React, Prisma + PostgreSQL (Neon), deploy on Vercel. Build runs `prisma migrate deploy`.
- **Local secrets:** `.env` (gitignored). **Vercel:** same variable names in dashboard — never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` for secrets.
- **Required prod env (typical):** `DATABASE_URL`, `JWT_SECRET` (≥32 chars on Vercel). Optional: `WEBHOOK_INBOUND_SECRET`, `ADMIN_EMAILS`, `ALLOW_DEV_USER_SWITCH`, `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL` + `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN` (both needed for API rate limiting in middleware).
- **DB:** B-tree indexes on frequent filter columns (see `prisma/migrations/`). Not using pg_trgm for `contains` text search unless added later.
- **Security code:** Middleware rate limits `/api/*` except `/api/webhooks/` and `/api/realtime/stream`. `src/lib/env.server.ts` + `src/instrumentation.ts` forbid dangerous `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` secret names. `auth.ts` is `server-only`. Upstash config in `src/lib/upstashEnv.ts` (Edge-safe; no `server-only` on middleware path).
- **XSS:** React text escaping; `safeHref.ts`; `escapeHtml.ts`; CSP + headers in `next.config.ts`; ESLint `react/no-danger`.
- **Sentry:** Optional — set `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN` in Vercel for errors + tracing + logs. `withSentryConfig` in `next.config.ts` only when DSN is set. `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN` optional for source maps upload. Files: `src/sentry.*.config.ts`, `src/instrumentation-client.ts`, `src/app/global-error.tsx`, merged `src/instrumentation.ts` (`onRequestError`).
- **Messaging queue (DB):** `BackgroundJob` Prisma model. App code should use `publishMessage` / `consumeQueueBatch` in `src/lib/messagingQueue.ts` (types: `src/lib/messagingQueueTypes.ts`); implementation in `src/lib/jobQueue.ts`. Handlers in `src/lib/jobHandlers.ts`. Cron: `GET /api/cron/process-jobs` + `CRON_SECRET` in prod. `vercel.json` — daily cron on Hobby (change schedule on Pro if needed).
- **Auth:** Register/login יוצרים עוגיית המתנה (לא סשן מלא) עד אימות OTP בן 6 ספרות במייל. אחרי אימות: סשן מלא. `/auth/verify-email` + `POST /api/auth/verify-email` עם `{ code }`. Resend: `POST /api/auth/resend-verification`. `getCurrentUser` מחזיר null אם `emailVerified` false. זמני בלי דומיין: `DISABLE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=true` מדלג על OTP ונותן סשן מלא מיד.
- **Forgot password:** `PasswordResetToken` model (hashed token, 1h TTL, single-use). `POST /api/auth/forgot-password` (generic 200, no email enumeration) + `POST /api/auth/reset-password`. UI: `/auth/forgot-password`, `/auth/reset-password`. Token helper: `src/lib/passwordReset.ts`. Delivery via background job `password.reset.requested` → `sendPasswordResetEmail` (Resend). Optional `PASSWORD_RESET_WEBHOOK_URL` as additional sink.
- **Email (Resend):** `RESEND_API_KEY` + `EMAIL_FROM` (דומיין מאומת ב-Resend, לא `vercel.app`). בפרוד קוד OTP / קישור איפוס **לא** מוצגים על המסך אלא אם `ENABLE_EMAIL_VERIFY_CODE_FALLBACK=true`. `DISABLE_EMAIL_VERIFY_CODE_FALLBACK=true` תמיד חוסם. בדיקה: `/api/health` → `emailVerifyCodeOnScreenFallback` / `emailVerificationDisabled`.
- **Image uploads:** Both venues (`src/lib/venueImageUpload.ts`) and freelancer services (`src/lib/serviceImageUpload.ts`) use Vercel Blob in prod via `BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN`, fall back to `public/uploads/` in dev. Never `mkdir`/`writeFile` on Vercel directly — filesystem is read-only.
- **After security changes:** never commit `.env`. Offer to commit with `security: …` and push only when the user explicitly asks (see `no-auto-push` rule).
- **Git:** do not auto-commit or auto-push when finishing work — wait for an explicit user request.
